payload.longDescriptionOriginal:
Handymade is a European online shop for raw materials and supplies for making natural cosmetics, soaps, candles and other handmade products: oils and butters, emulsifiers, preservatives, actives, essential and fragrance oils, colorants, waxes, molds, packaging and tools, with national shops in many EU languages.

With the Handymade app you can ask in your own language:
- find products by name, ingredient, INCI name or product code, with package sizes, current prices including VAT in your shop's currency, availability and links;
- read product details exactly as published on the product page: description, INCI, CAS, origin, function in the formula, recommended usage level, processing temperature, solubility, certifications and more;
- check quality documents: certificates of analysis per batch (measured results vs. specification), IFRA certificates with maximum use levels per product category, fragrance allergen declarations and technical data sheets;
- search Handymade's tested recipes, how-to guides, ingredient encyclopedia and cosmetics-regulation articles; recipes come with a shopping list that links every ingredient to the product to buy.

The app is read-only and needs no account. Ordering and payment happen on the Handymade website.
